  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "PAGE & PANEL\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 15, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Panels\n   2 Gutter\n   3 Balloon against caption\n   4 Panel size\n   5 Breaking the frame\n   6 Words per panel\n   7 Sound effects\n   8 Page-turn reveal\n   9 suite: Steady six-panel grid\n  10 suite: Splash-page reveal\n  11 suite: Silent page\n  12 suite: Talky page\n  13 suite: Three-panel strip gag\n  14 suite: Action page\n  15 suite: Ink comic\n  16 pair: When a page ends on a cliffhanger, the next page opens big\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 15, CC 17 to 26\n   1 pair: When the feeling peaks, the panel grows\n   2 pair: When the talk speeds up, panels shrink and multiply\n   3 pair: When a scene ends, the gutter widens\n   4 pair: When words move from speech balloons into captions, we hear what the character is really thinking\n   5 pair: When a picture breaks out of its panel, the page bursts with energy\n   6 pair: When the words thin out, the pictures get bigger\n   7 pair: When a picture fills the whole page, the sound effects grow as big as the page\n   8 pair: When a sound effect fills the page, the picture bursts out of its frame\n   9 pairs: The page breathes with the story\n  10 pairs: The loud page"
   },
   "pos": [
